  "text_md": "  <tr>\n- 37\n    <td>14. Adjunct</td>\n  </tr>\n    <td>A menina está a molhar o cão. the girl is PREP wet-INF the dog ‘The girl is wetting the dog.’</td>\n- 46\n- 44\n- 11\n- 18\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n- 38\n    <td>2. Training item</td>\n    <td>7. Direct object</td>\n- 19\n- 31\n  </tr>\n</table>\n- 41\n- 39\n- 6\n- 59\n  </tr>\n  </tr>\n    <td>O bebé está a tomar banho com o gato. the baby is PREP take-INF bath with the cat ‘The baby is taking a bath with the cat.’</td>\n    <td>E a mesa é amarela. and the table is yellow ‘And the table is yellow.’</td>\n    <td>O menino está a saltar na mesa. the boy is PREP jump-INF on+the table ‘The boy is jumping on the table.’</td>\n    <td>O cão está a morder o sapato. the dog is PREP bite-INF the shoe. ‘The dog is biting the shoe.’</td>\n- 60\n- 50\n## Appendix\n    <td>11. Control</td>\n    <td>1b.Training item</td>\n- 5\n    <td>O bebé está a comer a banana na cadeira. the baby is PREP eat-INF the banana on+the chair ‘The baby is eating the banana on the chair.’</td>\n  <tr>\n    <td>A mãe está a pentear o bebé. the mother is PREP comb-INF the baby ‘The mother is combing the baby’s hair.’</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  </tr>\n    <td>or Peer Review<br><br>O menino está a mostrar o desenho ao gato. the boy is PREP show-INF the drawing to+the cat ‘The boy is showing the drawing to the cat.’</td>\n  <tr>\n    <td>13. Direct object</td>\n  </tr>\n- 49\n    <td>F<br><br>8. Dative</td>\n- 7\n- 15\n- 34\n- 30\n    <td>5. Subject</td>\n    <td>Esta cadeira é cor-de-laranja. this chair is orange ‘This chair is orange.’</td>\n  <tr>\n    <td>O menino está a molhar o gato. the boy is PREP wet-INF the cat ‘The boy is wetting the cat.’</td>\n- 9\n    <td>Stimulus</td>\n  <tr>\n- 33\n- 58\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n- 42\n  </tr>",
