      "html": "<table><tr><td>1a. Training item</td><td>Esta cadeira é cor-de-laranja. this chair is orange ‘This chair is orange.’</td></tr><tr><td>Condition</td><td>Stimulus</td></tr><tr><td>3. Training item</td><td>(apontando para o cão) Este aqui é o gato. this here is the cat (pointing at the dog) ‘This one here is the cat.’</td></tr><tr><td>13. Direct object</td><td>A menina está a comer a maçã. the girl is PREP eat-INF the apple ‘The girl is eating the apple.’</td></tr><tr><td>11. Control</td><td>O menino está a molhar o gato. the boy is PREP wet-INF the cat ‘The boy is wetting the cat.’</td></tr><tr><td>2. Training item</td><td>(apontando para o pato) Este é um pato. this is a duck (pointing at the duck) ‘This one is a duck.’</td></tr><tr><td>F 8. Dative</td><td>or Peer Review O menino está a mostrar o desenho ao gato. the boy is PREP show-INF the drawing to+the cat ‘The boy is showing the drawing to the cat.’</td></tr><tr><td>6. Control</td><td>A mãe está a pentear o bebé. the mother is PREP comb-INF the baby ‘The mother is combing the baby’s hair.’</td></tr></table>",
